      "message": "fees: count mined weight in coverage\n\nTransactions with the same txid can have different witnesses in our\nmempool and the connected block. Count each match using the mined\nvariant's weight so the local witness size cannot skew the health check.\n\nUpdate the statistic comment and `estimatesmartfee` help to describe\nthe mined weight.",
